flowchart LR
  subgraph SRC[Sources · each value carries its origin and age]
    S1[Onboarding + Profile<br/>self-reported]
    S2[Logs and check-ins<br/>entered by the athlete]
    S3[Recorders and sensors<br/>measured]
    S4[Apple Health<br/>measured elsewhere]
  end
  AM[Athlete model<br/>one owner per field<br/>self-reported · measured · estimated · missing]
  EV[Evidence ledger<br/>sessions · ratings · pain · readings<br/>append-only]
  subgraph CORE[Coach core · deterministic]
    AN[Analysis<br/>load · trends · adherence · pain · breaks]
    PL[Planner<br/>week · strength session · ride session]
    DE[Decision engine<br/>classifies every action]
    VA[Validator<br/>safety · time · equipment · split]
  end
  DL[(Decision log<br/>observation · recommendation ·<br/>athlete decision · plan change)]
  PV[(Plan + plan versions)]
  EX[Explanation layer<br/>templates today · optional AI wording later<br/>cannot change a decision]
  UI[Home · Plan · Train · Progress · Profile · Coach page]
  S1 --> AM
  S2 & S3 & S4 --> EV
  AM --> AN & PL
  EV --> AN
  AN --> DE
  PL --> DE
  DE --> VA
  VA -->|protective change · applied, listed, undoable| PV
  VA -->|increase or structural change · waits for approval| DL
  DE --> DL
  DL -->|approved| PV
  DL --> EX --> UI
  PV --> UI
  UI -->|approve · reject · undo · edit| DL
